{"id":"n28108-7-6","stage":2,"title":"뚫다 · 找路子","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n28108-7-6-1","ko":"사업을 크게 키워서 내년에는 해외 시장도 뚫어 봅시다.","zh":"咱们把业务规模扩大，明年试着打入海外市场吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"사업을","meaning":"事业，生意","explanation":"사업：事业，生意；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"사업","audio":"/audio/7b3733aab2fd0dcf59d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62048","senseId":"1","lemma":"사업","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"크게","meaning":"大，大大，大把地","explanation":"크다：大，大大，大把地；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"크다","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66586","senseId":"13","lemma":"크다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"키워서","meaning":"扩大，壮大，发展","explanation":"키우다：扩大，壮大，发展；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"키우다","audio":"/audio/cff5458b4f7fee672311.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66587","senseId":"1","lemma":"키우다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"내년에는","meaning":"明年，来年","explanation":"내년：明年，来年；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"내년","audio":"/audio/c8cd8eb075e5a929b53e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64517","senseId":"1","lemma":"내년","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"해외","meaning":"海外，国外","explanation":"해외：海外，国外","readings":[{"term":"해외","audio":"/audio/82862092ebbd4ef94342.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62481","senseId":"1","lemma":"해외","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"시장도","meaning":"市场","explanation":"시장：市场；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"시장","audio":"/audio/b46fa208d9de21d2daf1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17193","senseId":"2","lemma":"시장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뚫어","meaning":"找路子，打开","explanation":"뚫다：找路子，打开；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"뚫다","audio":"/audio/3b827aefd0c1657d2170.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28108","senseId":"7","lemma":"뚫다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"봅시다.","meaning":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：试着做（-아/어 보다）；ㅂ시다：较正式的提议句末：“一起……吧”，通常用于平辈或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"7b3733aab2fd0dcf","term":"사업","zh":"事业，生意","audio":"/audio/7b3733aab2fd0dcf59d4.mp3","entryId":"62048","definition":"为取得经济利益而经营某种组织。","pronunciation":["사ː업"]},{"id":"d9eb2cf86baea929","term":"크다","zh":"大，大大，大把地","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3","entryId":"66586","definition":"表示“扩大范围时”。","pronunciation":["크다"]},{"id":"cff5458b4f7fee67","term":"키우다","zh":"扩大，壮大，发展","audio":"/audio/cff5458b4f7fee672311.mp3","entryId":"66587","definition":"使长度、宽度、高度、体积等变大。","pronunciation":["키우다"]},{"id":"c8cd8eb075e5a929","term":"내년","zh":"明年，来年","audio":"/audio/c8cd8eb075e5a929b53e.mp3","entryId":"64517","definition":"今年的下一年。","pronunciation":["내년"]},{"id":"82862092ebbd4ef9","term":"해외","zh":"海外，国外","audio":"/audio/82862092ebbd4ef94342.mp3","entryId":"62481","definition":"不是自己国家，别的国家。","pronunciation":["해ː외","해ː웨"]},{"id":"b46fa208d9de21d2","term":"시장","zh":"市场","audio":"/audio/b46fa208d9de21d2daf1.mp3","entryId":"17193","definition":"进行商品、财富、服务等交易的抽象领域。","pronunciation":["시ː장"]},{"id":"3b827aefd0c1657d","term":"뚫다","zh":"找路子，打开","audio":"/audio/3b827aefd0c1657d2170.mp3","entryId":"28108","definition":"找出解决方法。","pronunciation":["뚤타"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/4a34a9cca41862a876f3.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n28108-7-6-2","ko":"좋습니다. 열심히 해 봅시다!","zh":"好啊，那我们就努力试试吧！","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"좋습니다.","meaning":"行，可以","explanation":"좋다：行，可以；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"12","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"열심히","meaning":"认真地","explanation":"열심히：认真地","readings":[{"term":"열심히","audio":"/audio/5be015e332c130d89835.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67512","senseId":"1","lemma":"열심히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"해","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"봅시다!","meaning":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：试着做（-아/어 보다）；ㅂ시다：较正式的提议句末：“一起……吧”，通常用于平辈或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"行，可以","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"某个行动或事情等不成问题。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]},{"id":"5be015e332c130d8","term":"열심히","zh":"认真地","audio":"/audio/5be015e332c130d89835.mp3","entryId":"67512","definition":"对于某事专心诚意地。","pronunciation":["열씸히"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/6b3d592ad14536e391c9.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.627,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=28108","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"7","sourceLevel":"중급","day":86,"sequenceScore":2.3523,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["好啊，那我们就努力试试吧！","怎么这么脏，用手拿食物吃啊？","咱们把业务规模扩大，明年试着打入海外市场吧。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["好啊，那我们就努力试试吧！","咱们把业务规模扩大，明年试着打入海外市场吧。","怎么这么脏，用手拿食物吃啊？"],"answer":0}]}
